{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve the lifecycle assertion when cleanup also fails**\n\nAn exception raised by `cleanup_timeout_case` in this `finally` replaces any active assertion from `assert_timeout_case`, misclassifying the SDK regression as a collection/cleanup error. Preserve and re-raise the primary failure while recording cleanup separately; raise the cleanup failure only when the assertion itself succeeded. Add coverage where both operations fail.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc703gXa","finding_digest":"8d56904dcb2db3988109cdfe92f79da561f0bb0eb504baff4eaad8b763ca2316","finding_id":"arf_v1_rvljatolfwzzraijzx7jf545uv","finding_key":"lmi-tests/cloud_suite.py::timeout_case::primary-failure-preservation","identity_key":"lmi-tests/cloud_suite.py::timeout_case::primary-failure-preservation","line":459,"observation_digest":"809c1a0b489beea2d8c0981b500514e14defa0352fea7e0719fb68b123cea140","observation_id":"aro_v1_qcobuc2itpxkfwgatanvabiu4f","path":"lmi-tests/cloud_suite.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-25T20:03:36Z","review_id":"arr_v1_4g3gjtfg4uz66bh74knsmw5pvh","reviewed_base_sha":"518cba16e0e690e1939feff222915ce841aa960b","reviewed_head_sha":"b36047acb3afdd294ad3421e751071036c76a47d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":456,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":728},"record_id":"art_v1_drxsounr6vd3mvk4yqdemu4vod","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-25T20:03:36Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
